{"id": "7-891", "question": "A recyclable material can be", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): transformed", "B): traded", "C): thrown away", "D): used more times"], "correct": "D", "initial_cot": "1. A recyclable material is a substance that can be processed and used again.\n2. The purpose of recycling is to reduce waste and conserve resources.\n3. Transforming a recyclable material means changing its form or composition to create something new.\n4. Trading a recyclable material means exchanging it for something else.\n5. Throwing away a recyclable material means disposing of it as waste.\n6. Using a recyclable material more times means reusing it without transforming it.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.4454561096499674e-05, 1.4170754525366647e-07, 1.4170754525366647e-07, 3.22524851981143e-06], "initial_probs": [0.00014961596752982587, 9.564628271618858e-06, 1.6620832639091532e-06, 2.9461127269314602e-05], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "cot_step": "A recyclable material is a substance that can be processed and used again.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "A recyclable material is a substance that can be processed and used again.", "2.", "The purpose of recycling is to reduce waste and conserve resources.", "3.", "Transforming a recyclable material means changing its form or composition to create something new.", "4.", "Trading a recyclable material means exchanging it for something else.", "5.", "Throwing away a recyclable material means disposing of it as waste.", "6.", "Using a recyclable material more times means reusing it without transforming it."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "A).\n\nRecyclable materials are", "probs": [0.00014961596752982587, 9.564628271618858e-06, 1.6620832639091532e-06, 2.9461127269314602e-05], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "A recyclable material is a substance that can be processed and used again.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: A recyclable material can be\n\nChoices:\n(A): transformed\n(B): traded\n(C): thrown